, "text": "It is not something I would normally come about."}, {"start": 35.888, "end": 36.768, "text": "I am glad you did."}, {"start": 37.348, "end": 39.769, "text": "We ran some tests after we last spoke."}, {"start": 40.429, "end": 42.569, "text": "Yes, I was a bit worried about those."}, {"start": 43.15, "end": 44.43, "text": "They came back reassuring."}, {"start": 44.93, "end": 46.571, "text": "Your thyroid tests are normal."}, {"start": 47.251, "end": 48.231, "text": "Normal, right."}, {"start": 48.751, "end": 50.932, "text": "And your coronavirus test was negative."}, {"start": 51.512, "end": 53.812, "text": "Oh, that is good, I think."}, {"start": 54.433, "end": 54.753, "text": "It is."}, {"start": 55.473, "end": 57.653, "text": "Neither of those is behind the tiredness."}, {"start": 58.254, "end": 59.474, "text": "So what is causing it?"}, {"start": 60.038, "end": 61.179, "text": "That is the honest part."}, {"start": 61.739, "end": 64.16, "text": "We have not identified a specific cause."}, {"start": 65.121, "end": 66.462, "text": "So you do not know?"}, {"start": 67.062, "end": 68.303, "text": "Not at this stage, no."}, {"start": 68.903, "end": 70.544, "text": "It does not mean nothing is there."}, {"start": 71.064, "end": 73.445, "text": "It means nothing has shown up so far."}, {"start": 73.966, "end": 74.426, "text": "I see."}, {"start": 74.926, "end": 76.687, "text": "Maybe that is better than bad news."}, {"start": 77.307, "end": 79.289, "text": "I would take it as reassuring for now."}, {"start": 79.909, "end": 81.41, "text": "So what happens next?"}, {"start": 81.93, "end": 85.732, "text": "For the moment we observe, I am not starting anything further today."}, {"start": 86.212, "end": 86.853, "text": "Nothing at all?"}, {"start": 87.393, "end": 89.094, "text": "Nothing further is needed right now."}, {"start": 89.61, "end": 91.391, "text": "We watch how the tiredness behaves."}, {"start": 92.011, "end": 92.412, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 92.692, "end": 93.793, "text": "I think I understand."}, {"start": 94.413, "end": 94.673, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 95.313, "end": 96.954, "text": "Have you got anything on this weekend?"}, {"start": 97.495, "end": 98.015, "text": "Not much."}, {"start": 98.355, "end": 99.716, "text": "Something quiet, probably."}, {"start": 100.256, "end": 101.277, "text": "Quiet sounds fitting."}, {"start": 101.677, "end": 102.178, "text": "Enjoy it."}, {"start": 102.598, "end": 103.078, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 103.598, "end": 104.339, "text": "Take care, Nana."}, {"start": 104.599, "end": 104.999, "text": "Goodbye."}, {"start": 105.38, "end": 105.78, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.075}}